# PROV-O subset, extracted by scripts/extract_prov_subset.py -- DO NOT HAND-EDIT.
#
# 4 classes and 8 properties from https://www.w3.org/ns/prov-o-20130430.ttl
# (sha256 3d03c8e15753178541fb8cd59fbefecaf1861f9c37ef75190c6e938b85fb0c3d). Regenerate with `make prov`.
#
